<title>POLAND: Polish grain prices fall, pork up in March.</title>
<headline>Polish grain prices fall, pork up in March.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish procurement grain prices fell in March, cattle and milk prices remained stable and pork prices increased, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>POLISH FARM GOODS PRICES		 MARCH   FEBRUARY  MARCH 96</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>   in zlotys per 100 kg		  52.84     54.06    58.80</p>
<p>   month/month change (pct)	    -2.2	-2.4     12.9</p>
<p>   yr/yr change (pct)		   -10.1	 3.8     64.6</p>
<p>RYE</p>
<p>   in zlotys per 100 kg		  40.73     41.25    31.49</p>
<p>   month/month change (pct)	    -1.3	 1.1	5.8</p>
<p>   yr/yr change (pct)		    29.4	38.6     36.9</p>
<p>CATTLE</p>
<p>   in zlotys per kg			 2.57	2.57     2.67</p>
<p>   month/month change (pct)	    -0.1	-1.4	0.9</p>
<p>   yr/yr change (pct)		    -3.5	-2.5     27.6</p>
<p>PORK</p>
<p>   in zlotys per kg			 3.41	3.23     2.69</p>
<p>   month/month change (pct)	     5.5	-4.2	4.2</p>
<p>   yr/yr change (pct)		    27.0	25.5	6.4</p>
<p>MILK</p>
<p>   in zlotys per litre		    0.57	0.57     0.52</p>
<p>   month/month change (pct)	     0.2	 1.1	0.4</p>
<p>   yr/yr change (pct)		    11.4	11.7     22.7</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
